{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16224410","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16224410","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1622441001:1":{"text":"チュン……北風だ！唸りを上げてるぞ！今こそ翼を広げるときだ！","source_cn":"啾咕咕……北风！是北风！北风呼啸之时，张开你的翅膀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA77786F9ECED0414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1622441002:1":{"text":"なんて温かく、力強い風……きっとご先祖様が、俺たちに応えてくれたんだ！シルヴァン様もありがとうございます！","source_cn":"这风……温暖而有力，一定是先祖回应了我们的勇气！感谢您...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB877FDB8662BEC7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1622441003:1":{"text":"お前さんたちに希望を与えるのは、先祖でもオレでもない。逆境の中で自ら呼び覚ました勇気と、生まれながらに持つその翼だ。","source_cn":"给予你们希望的不是先祖或我，而是你们自己在绝境中唤醒的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B9CDD11B5EE1C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1622441004:1":{"text":"この北風も最初からこの森に宿っちょったもんで、オレがちょっくら早く起こしただけだ。","source_cn":"这股北风，本就孕育于这片森林的呼吸，我只是提前将它唤醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6027B2FE7733A743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1622441005:1":{"text":"さあ飛べ！南へ向かい、お前さんたちの冬の住処を築いてこい！","source_cn":"飞吧，去南方建立你们的冬季家园。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C126CA1A66D764E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_inde